<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO 96 NET RISES TO PLN 15.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO 96 NET RISES TO PLN 15.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.69 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.87 vs   1.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.60 vs   1.90</p>
<p> Sales		   14.28 vs  13.39</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.75 vs  10.99</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	25.04 vs  18.85</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.14 vs  22.94</p>
<p> Sales		  171.16 vs 148.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
